<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιερός</span></b>  or (less freq.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιᾰρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιά</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shady, giving shade</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νέμεϊ σκιερῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.480
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλσος ὕπο σκιερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.278
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιαρόν τε φύτευμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					3.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιεροῖσιν ὑφ᾽ ἕρνεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ibyc.
					1.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιερᾷ δάφνᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					1246
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ σκιερὰ φυλλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος σκιερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					349
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιεροῖσι πόθοισι</span>
			longings <i>for the shade</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.438
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shady, in the shade</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιεροὺς θώκους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					574
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ σκιαρᾶν παγᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					3.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάπαυλαι σκιαραί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					625b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>dark-coloured</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).655
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ς. μέλαν φαίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Col.</u>
					791a23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιερῆς ἄνθος ὀπώρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.154
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Gaet.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρίκῃ ς. θάλαττα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖται ὑπὸ σκιερὰν Σύρου κόνιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).675.5
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Syros</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>faint</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					6.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
